{"unit_id":"clusterstar1229__dsh-sidebar-control#card-zh","repo":"clusterstar1229/dsh-sidebar-control","commit":"58812828d7b78bbb1beaa7f904be14a3791ea676","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Sidebar Control 是 DeepSeek Harness 的侧栏浏览器控制插件，通过 `builtin_browser` 工具让 Agent 在右栏内置浏览器中查看和操作网页。它可读取页面快照、按问题筛选相关段落、比较两次页面变化，并用一次批量调用完成多步操作；也支持点击、输入、滚动、截图和多标签管理。适合需要在网页界面中查找信息、填写表单或跟进页面变化的 DSH 用户。它依赖 Harness 页面和内置浏览器，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:473-527","client.js:849-911","client.js:987-1049"]}
{"unit_id":"clusterstar1229__dsh-sidebar-control#card-en","repo":"clusterstar1229/dsh-sidebar-control","commit":"58812828d7b78bbb1beaa7f904be14a3791ea676","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Sidebar Control lets a DeepSeek Harness agent operate its built-in sidebar browser through `builtin_browser`. It can snapshot pages, find query-matched passages, compare changes, batch steps, click, type, scroll, capture screenshots, and manage tabs. It needs the Harness page and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:473-527","client.js:849-911","client.js:987-1049"]}
